  "description": "The act of cooking food, typically outdoors, over an open flame or heat source. In the context of the meme, it represents a casual, social, and often celebratory activity that contrasts sharply with the solemnity of a cemetery. This contrast is central to the meme's dark humor and is a real-world concept that must be understood to interpret the joke.",
